# Changelog
## [1.0.0-rc1] - 2026-11-15
### Breaking changes
 - API break: Reduce public API surface. (8a60bbe)
 - Unify public error type on `GenetlinkError`. (676b331)

### New features
 - Add multicast group name resolution. (5c96c47)

### Bug fixes
 - Adopt netlink-packet-core and netlink-proto 1.0.0-rc2. (a90a3b1)
 - Harden RawGenlMessage and derive header length. (4a5c72b)
 - Allow invalidating individual cached families. (b6006b9)
 - Improve CI checks. (1f23e4e)
 - Clean up Cargo metadata and features. (ad2eb2c)
 - Add multicast group subscription helpers. (2f6df3a)
 - Preserve socket error kind when creating connections. (ff2cc96)
 - Preserve netlink error details. (9a205c6)
 - Expose GenetlinkHandle constructor. (9e797dd)
 - Expose additional family metadata. (be5532a)
 - Relax handle and resolver borrows. (afccfcb)
 - Finalize generic header before raw serialization. (c8c0e1e)
 - Set NLM_F_REQUEST when sending requests. (3dda4d5)
 - Use futures-util and futures-channel. (6a265a4)
 - Use latest rust-netlink crates. (6d74a08)

